  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "How do you bring your own workload inventory into EMOS?",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 5.563925307906237,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "Start with the sample dataset to understand the structure, or choose a sanitized CSV or",
      "start": 5.563925307906237,
      "end": 11.960667461263407,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "JSON portfolio.",
      "start": 11.960667461263407,
      "end": 12.952959872864518,
      "chapter": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "The import path checks the schema and applies input-safety controls.",
      "start": 12.952959872864518,
      "end": 17.258800158919346,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Review the imported workload records and the evidence they contain before drawing",
      "start": 17.258800158919346,
      "end": 21.58235995232419,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "conclusions.",
      "start": 21.58235995232419,
      "end": 22.025347636074688,
      "chapter": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Importing a row does not verify every claim or make the workload ready.",
      "start": 22.025347636074688,
      "end": 26.189431863329354,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Open Enterprise DNA to inspect known, incomplete, and missing evidence, then carry that",
      "start": 26.189431863329354,
      "end": 31.363528009535155,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "context into assessment.",
      "start": 31.363528009535155,
      "end": 32.49757647993643,
      "chapter": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Use the sample estates for representative demonstrations.",
      "start": 32.49757647993643,
      "end": 35.7756853396901,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Imported data is not live CMDB or telemetry discovery.",
      "start": 35.7756853396901,
      "end": 39.39932459276916,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Next, select an imported workload, close its critical gaps, and review its six R",
      "start": 39.39932459276916,
      "end": 44.52912197059992,
      "chapter": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "recommendation.",
